Q1.Why did Chrome show success but Electron showed failure?
Ans- Chrome (Playwright) successfully generated the image. The backend received the response, extracted... nothing, threw "URL not found", marked the job as failed.
The Electron app polls for job status, sees failed, shows "Generation failed". The Chrome window stayed open because the browser stayed visible — but the Electron side never got the URL.
POC flow==>
Electron → Backend API → BullMQ queue → Worker → flowProxy → 
Playwright (opens Chrome) → Flow generates image → intercepts response → 
extracts URL → saves to DB → Electron polls job → shows image
